    "cultural": "Sharing food is central to Thai social culture. The phrase \u0E17\u0E32\u0E19\u0E02\u0E49\u0E32\u0E27\u0E22\u0E31\u0E07 (thaan-kh\xE2ao-yang) \u2014 have you eaten yet \u2014 is a common greeting showing how central food is to Thai life. Food connects people in Thai culture more than almost anything else.",
